1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:06,000
Mandate is an autonomous procure-to-pay system governed by a sealed Authority Envelope.

2
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:11,500
The CFO fixes approved payees and spending limits before the invoice is read.

3
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:17,200
ArmorIQ authorizes delegated agent actions through the sole gateway.

4
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:24,000
When an invoice proposes an unauthorized payee, the request is blocked before the payment tool runs, and the ledger remains unchanged.

5
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:30,500
This prototype uses the local ArmorIQ contract adapter, clearly disclosed in the interface.
